==== hyperbricks yaml {!{myComponent}} ====
myComponent:
  - type: template
  - enclose: <div id="image-container">|</div>
  - inline: "\n<img src=\"{{.src}}\" alt=\"{{.alt}}\" width=\"{{.width}}\" height=\"{{.height}}\">\n    "
  - values:
      alt: Girl in a jacket
      height: "600"
      src: img_girl.jpg
      width: "500"
==== explainer ====
Enclosing property for the template rendered output divided by |
==== expected json ====
{
  "AllowedQueryKeys": null,
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<TEMPLATE>",
  "Enclose": "<div id=\"image-container\">|</div>",
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Inline": "\n<img src=\"{{.src}}\" alt=\"{{.alt}}\" width=\"{{.width}}\" height=\"{{.height}}\">\n    ",
  "Items": null,
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "QueryParams": null,
  "Template": "",
  "Values": {
    "alt": "Girl in a jacket",
    "height": "600",
    "src": "img_girl.jpg",
    "width": "500"
  }
}

==== expected output ====
<div id="image-container"><img src="img_girl.jpg" alt="Girl in a jacket" width="500" height="600"></div> 
